      "question": "The agent has successfully identified an angry customer and is currently processing a billing dispute. The customer\nbecomes aggressive and insults the agent. What is the most robust way to trigger the `escalate_to_human` tool?\n\n* Rely on the model to \"detect\" the aggression and call the tool independently.\n* Implement a sentiment analysis middleware that interrupts the conversation flow if the sentiment score drops below a\n  threshold.\n* Add a hard rule in the system prompt: \"If the customer uses profanity or aggressive tone, immediately call\n  `escalate_to_human` and stop processing.\"\n* Train the agent to ignore the aggression and continue resolving the issue to maintain FCR.",
