      "question": "After retrieving all system data, the agent faces uncertainty. Which situation represents the most appropriate trigger\nfor calling `escalate_to_human`?\n\n* A) The customer's message mentions both a billing and a product return.\n* B) The customer claims they never received their order, but tracking shows it was delivered and signed for.\n* **C) The customer requests a price match against a competitor. Your policies allow adjustments for your own site but\n  are silent on competitor pricing.**\n* D) The customer wants to cancel an order that shipped yesterday, with delivery scheduled for tomorrow.",
