      "question": "Your agent misinterprets data from MCP tools (mixed formats: Unix timestamps, ISO 8601, and numeric status codes). Some\nare third-party servers you cannot modify. What is the most maintainable approach to normalize data formats?\n\n* A) Add detailed format documentation to your system prompt.\n* **B) Use a PostToolUse hook to intercept tool results and apply formatting transformations before agent processing.**\n* C) Create a `normalize_data` tool that the agent calls after each data retrieval.\n* D) Modify tools you control; create wrapper tools for third-party tools.",
