      "correctAnswer": "Return structured error context to the coordinator including the failure type, the attempted query, any partial\nresults, and potential alternative approaches.\n\nStructured error context gives the coordinator the information needed to make intelligent recovery decisions\u2014whether to\nretry with a modified query, try an alternative approach, or proceed with partial results. Generic statuses hide\nvaluable context, suppressing errors prevents recovery, and terminating the workflow is unnecessarily destructive.",
      "explanation": "Return structured error context to the coordinator including the failure type, the attempted query, any partial\nresults, and potential alternative approaches.\n\nStructured error context gives the coordinator the information needed to make intelligent recovery decisions\u2014whether to\nretry with a modified query, try an alternative approach, or proceed with partial results. Generic statuses hide\nvaluable context, suppressing errors prevents recovery, and terminating the workflow is unnecessarily destructive."
