      "explanation": "Use `Grep` to search for \"timeout\", \"session\", \"expir\" patterns, then `Read` relevant configuration files.\n\n`Grep` is the appropriate tool for searching content across files for specific patterns like configuration keywords.\nOnce potential locations are identified, `Read` allows examination of the configuration details. This is more efficient\nthan reading all configuration files manually."
