      "correctAnswer": "Add few-shot examples demonstrating extraction from documents with varied formats.\n\nFew-shot examples enable the model to generalize judgment to novel patterns rather than matching only pre-specified\ncases. Providing examples showing correct extraction from documents with varied formats (inline vs. structured, prose\nvs. tables) addresses the root cause of format variation better than pre-processing or separate schemas.",
      "explanation": "Add few-shot examples demonstrating extraction from documents with varied formats.\n\nFew-shot examples enable the model to generalize judgment to novel patterns rather than matching only pre-specified\ncases. Providing examples showing correct extraction from documents with varied formats (inline vs. structured, prose\nvs. tables) addresses the root cause of format variation better than pre-processing or separate schemas."
