      "correctAnswer": "Extract both \"calculated_total\" and \"stated_total\", then add a \"total_mismatch\" boolean to flag discrepancies.\n\nSelf-correction validation flows should include redundant extraction fields that can be compared\u2014extracting \"\ncalculated_total\" alongside \"stated_total\" to flag discrepancies. This enables automated detection of extraction errors\ndirectly in the structured output.",
      "explanation": "Extract both \"calculated_total\" and \"stated_total\", then add a \"total_mismatch\" boolean to flag discrepancies.\n\nSelf-correction validation flows should include redundant extraction fields that can be compared\u2014extracting \"\ncalculated_total\" alongside \"stated_total\" to flag discrepancies. This enables automated detection of extraction errors\ndirectly in the structured output."
