      "correctAnswer": "Aggregate accuracy masks significant performance variation across document types.\n\nThe risk that aggregate accuracy metrics (e.g., 97% overall) may mask poor performance on specific document types or\nfields is a key concept. Stratified analysis by document type and field segment is required before automating\nhigh-confidence extractions or reducing human review.\n\n> **Study Area:** Structured Data Extraction \u2014 review *Accuracy Segmentation* concepts in the exam study guide.",
