      "question": "A web search subagent returns results for only 3 requested categories (timed out on 2). The document analysis subagent succeeded. The synthesis subagent must now produce a summary from this mixed-quality input.\n\n**What is the most effective error propagation strategy?**\n\n- **A.** Have the synthesis subagent return an error to the coordinator\n- **B.** Structure the synthesis output with coverage annotations indicating which findings are well-supported versus which topic areas have gaps\n- **C.** Have the synthesis subagent request a coordinator retry\n- **D.** Proceed with synthesis using only successful sources without indicating gaps",
