      "correctAnswer": "Prompt Claude to batch tool requests per turn.\n\nLeveraging Claude's native ability to batch multiple tool requests in a single turn is the most effective way to reduce API round-trips. This avoids the over-engineering and loss of flexibility associated with creating composite tools like `get_customer_with_orders`.",
      "explanation": "Prompt Claude to batch tool requests per turn.\n\nLeveraging Claude's native ability to batch multiple tool requests in a single turn is the most effective way to reduce API round-trips. This avoids the over-engineering and loss of flexibility associated with creating composite tools like `get_customer_with_orders`."
