      "correctAnswer": "Use a PostToolUse hook to intercept and normalize tool results.\n\nA PostToolUse hook provides a centralized, programmatic point for data normalization. This ensures all tool outputs\u2014including those from tools like `get_customer` or `lookup_order`\u2014are consistent before reaching the agent, which is more reliable than using a separate `normalize_data` tool.",
      "explanation": "Use a PostToolUse hook to intercept and normalize tool results.\n\nA PostToolUse hook provides a centralized, programmatic point for data normalization. This ensures all tool outputs\u2014including those from tools like `get_customer` or `lookup_order`\u2014are consistent before reaching the agent, which is more reliable than using a separate `normalize_data` tool."
