      "correctAnswer": "`tool_choice` with a specific tool name (forced mode).\n\n`tool_choice` with a specific tool name (forced mode) requires Claude to call that exact tool on every request. This ensures every document produces a structured extraction result \u2014 Claude cannot respond with plain text or skip the extraction. `auto` (A) allows Claude to decide not to use the tool. `any` (B) requires a tool call but allows choosing among multiple tools. No configuration (D) relies on prompt instructions, which are less deterministic.",
