      "question": "Following the launch of the \"Claude Certified Architect - Foundations (CCA-F)\" certification on March 12,\n2026, industry observers noted that this was only the first step in a broader educational roadmap. Which official source\nmost directly confirmed that additional certifications were planned to follow?\n\n* **A) The March 12, 2026 partner network announcement**\n* B) A random GitHub gist\n* C) An old community Reddit post\n* D) A generic cloud certification catalog",
