      "question": "An architect is designing a high-complexity agentic system that requires deep multi-step reasoning,\nautonomous coding capabilities, and handling of large, unstructured technical datasets. Which model should they\nprioritize as the primary engine for these demanding tasks?\n\n* A) Claude Haiku 4.5\n* B) Claude Sonnet 4.6\n* C) Any deprecated 3.x model\n* **D) Claude Opus 4.6**",
