      "question": "An enterprise architecture team is evaluating model tiers to determine the optimal balance between\ncomputational speed and reasoning intelligence for their core production workloads (e.g., high-volume agentic coding,\ninternal automation, and customer-facing assistants). Which model tier is explicitly characterized as providing the \"\nbest combination of speed and intelligence\"?\n\n* A) Claude Sonnet 3.7\n* **B) Claude Sonnet 4.6**\n* C) Claude Opus 3\n* D) Claude Haiku 3",
